Guide: Excellent work!

Guide: These Stones will strengthen everything we build.

do QuestManager.try_complete_quest()

Guide: You've proven that you can farm and gather resources.

Guide: Now it's time to put those skills to good use.

do QuestManager.start_quest("build_economy")

=> END


